  "detailedOccurrenceReport": "Sir,\n\n1. Tarikh 01 Sep 25 ko takriban 1130 baje, ek gambhir chori ki ghatna 5221 ASC Bn unit lines ke quarters mein pesh aayi. Jankari ke mutabik, Sep (MT) Ramu Singh ke ghar mein rakha hua keemti sona chori ho gaya hai. Yeh sona, jo ki lagbhag 17 thola bataya ja raha hai, ek velvet bag ke andar dalkar lohe ke iron box mein surakshit rakha gaya tha.\n\n2. Is mamle ka khulasa tab hua jab Sep (MT) Ramu Singh ki patni, Mrs. Ahir Khushbu, ne ghar ke rozana kamo ke dauran iron box ko check kiya. Unhone dekha ki box ka lock sahi tarah se band tha, magar andar rakha hua mukhya bag gayab tha. Unhone turant apne pati ko duty se wapas bulaya aur aas-paas ke logon se puchtach ki.\n\n3. Is chori ki ghatna mein, bahari taur par koi zabardasti ghusne ke nishan nahi mile hain, jo is baat ki taraf ishara karta hai ki chor ko ghar ki jankari thi ya usne nakli chabi ka istemal kiya. Is mamle ki gehri janch ki ja rahi hai aur sabhi sambhav pehluon par gaur kiya ja raha hai.",
  "pointsFindOutDuringInvestigation": "1. Incident Timeline: The theft occurred on 01 Sep 25, and was officially noticed and reported at approximately 1130 hours from the family quarters of Sep (MT) Ramu Singh.\n2. Property Details: The missing property consists of 17 Thola Gold, which was kept inside a velvet pouch, further secured within a locked iron box inside the house.\n3. Discovery of Theft: The loss was discovered by the victim's wife, Mrs. Ahir Khushbu, during a routine check. Notably, the external locks of the box appeared intact, suggesting the thief had specific knowledge of keys.",
